      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwerfen (Esc)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard Dictation": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diktat verwerfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard dictation": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diktat verwerfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discarded": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verworfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fertig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download %@ from Hugging Face (%@). Every file is checked before use. Recordings and text stay on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lade %@ von Hugging Face (%@). Jede Datei wird vor der Verwendung geprüft. Aufnahmen und Text bleiben auf deinem Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download and Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laden und installieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download-Fortschritt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloading %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ wird geladen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laden …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag Saywing into the list": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saywing in die Liste ziehen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag over text or click a paragraph  ·  Space moves  ·  Esc cancels": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Über Text ziehen oder Absatz anklicken  ·  Leertaste verschiebt  ·  Esc bricht ab"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag over the text to read, click a paragraph, or press Return to read the paragraph under the pointer. Hold Space to move the selection, Shift to lock an edge, Option to grow it from the centre. Press Escape to cancel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zieh über den Text, klick auf einen Absatz oder drück Return, um den Absatz unter dem Zeiger zu lesen. Leertaste halten verschiebt die Auswahl, Umschalt fixiert eine Kante, Wahl vergrößert von der Mitte aus. Esc bricht ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag the waveform to a screen edge": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wellenform an einen Bildschirmrand ziehen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fehler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escape": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esc"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escape always stops reading or discards dictation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escape stoppt jederzeit das Vorlesen oder verwirft das Diktat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escape discards this dictation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esc verwirft dieses Diktat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escape is in use by another app. Recording did not start; quit the other dictation app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esc wird von einer anderen App verwendet. Die Aufnahme wurde nicht gestartet; beende die andere Diktier-App."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escape key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esc-Taste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escape stops everything and clears the queue": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esc stoppt alles und leert die Warteschlange"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escape then stops reading while you work in another app. Saywing checks only the Escape key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dann stoppt Esc das Vorlesen auch, während du in einer anderen App arbeitest. Saywing achtet nur auf die Esc-Taste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything is processed on this Mac. Escape discards it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles wird auf diesem Mac verarbeitet. Esc verwirft das Diktat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything was read": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles vorgelesen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish & Paste": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beenden & einfügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Später fortsetzen"
          }
        }
